      "content": "it's just been kinda aching... i think i might have just pulled a muscle during my workout last week. i'm also feeling a bit lightheaded and short of breath right now. honestly i've been under so much stress at work lately, do u think this could just be anxiety? maybe i'm just overthinking it.",
